                        <div class="acco-item">

                           <h2 class="acco-link">A feature-rich Personal Loan with multiple benefits</h2>

                           <div class="acco-body">

                              <div class="tab-inner-content">

                                 <p>Credify Capital focuses on providing a feature-rich Personal Loan for all its customers across the location. It is an unsecured loan that helps you meet various financial needs. If you are considering taking a loan for personal use, you should first understand some of its important features.</p>

                                 <p><strong>Following are some of the Key Features of a Personal Loan:</strong></p>

                                 <table class="table table-border">

                                    <tbody><tr>

                                       <td align="center"><img src="/img/no-collateralsecurity.svg" width="35" height="35" alt="Collateral free professional loan logo"></td>

                                       <td><strong>No collateral/security</strong><br>

                                          You get the necessary funds without pledging any security. You can keep full possession of your assets and borrow money online without any hassles.

                                       </td>

                                    </tr>

                                    <tr>

                                       <td align="center"><img src="/img/flexible-repayment-tenure.svg" width="35" height="35" alt="Professional loan repayment tenure logo"></td>

                                       <td><strong>Flexible repayment tenure</strong><br>

                                          Credify Capital offers flexible repayment tenures ranging from 12 to 96 months. You have the freedom to choose the tenure as per your repayment capacity.

                                    </td></tr>

                                    <tr>

                                       <td align="center"><img src="/img/pocket-friendly-interest-rates.svg" width="35" height="35" alt="Professional loan interest rates logo"></td>

                                       <td><strong>Attractive interest rates</strong><br>

                                          We offer the loan at attractive interest rate, ensuring you save money by paying lower EMIs.

                                       </td>

                                    </tr>

                                    <tr>

                                       <td align="center"><img src="/img/Simplified-documentation-process.svg" width="35" height="35" alt="Business loan documents required logo"></td>

                                       <td><strong>Minimal documentation</strong><br>

                                          As it is an unsecured loan with no collateral, it requires minimal documentation, making the documentation process relatively simple and fast.

                                       </td>

                                    </tr>

                                    <tr>

                                       <td align="center"><img src="/img/higher-loan-disbursal-amount.svg" width="35" height="35" alt="Professional loan disbursal amount logo"></td>

                                       <td><strong>Multi-purpose high loan amount with no restrictions on usage</strong><br>

                                         With Credify Capital's Fintech platform Personal Loan, you can avail a loan amount of up to ₹1 Cr. The funds can be used for a variety of purposes, including medical emergencies, home renovation, higher education, and more—without any end-use restrictions.

                                       </td>

                                    </tr>

                                    <tr>

                                       <td align="center"><img src="/img/quick-approvals.svg" width="35" height="35" alt="Professional loan approval logo"></td>

                                       <td><strong>Quick approvals</strong><br>

                                          Loan processing can be tedious and time-consuming, but we promise a seamless experience. Thanks to our minimal and relaxed eligibility criteria, you can avail of a quick loan when you need funds. We approve loan applications instantly and disburse your approved sanction in no time.

                                       </td>

                                    </tr>

                                    <tr>

                                       <td align="center"><img src="/img/easy-processing.svg" width="35" height="35" alt="Professional loan easy processing logo"></td>

                                       <td><strong>Easy and hassle-free process</strong><br>

                                          We leverage technology to minimize the effort required for loan application. You can apply online for our offering in just a few easy steps through the user-friendly online journey!

                                    </td></tr>

                                 </tbody></table>

