                        <div class="acco-item">

                           <h2 class="acco-link">Ways to Use a Credify Capital Personal Loan</h2>

                           <div class="acco-body">

                              <div class="tab-inner-content">

                                 <p>With complete flexibility regarding its usage, the loan can be used to address any expense. Some of the most common reasons for taking a loan are:</p>

                                 <div class="overviewbullet">

                                    <ul>

                                       <li class="flex items-start gap-3 my-2"><span class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1"><img src="/img/home-redecorations.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="Renovate a house-  Whether you want to rebuild your kitchen, build a new balcony, or make any other home modification, you can cover any costs of home renovations." class="w-7 h-7 object-contain" /></span><div><strong>Renovate a house- </strong> Whether you want to rebuild your kitchen, build a new balcony, or make any other home modification, you can cover any costs of home renovations.</div></li>

                                       <li class="flex items-start gap-3 my-2"><span class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1"><img src="/img/financing-education.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="Fund child’s higher education-  Apply for a Personal Loan to cover the cost of your child's higher education, such as admission fees." class="w-7 h-7 object-contain" /></span><div><strong>Fund child’s higher education- </strong> Apply for a Personal Loan to cover the cost of your child's higher education, such as admission fees.</div></li>

                                       <li class="flex items-start gap-3 my-2"><span class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1"><img src="/img/medical-emergencies.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="Pay medical bills-  Medical emergencies can take a toll on your finances. Even if you have health insurance, it may not cover all medical expenses during emergency. You may need prompt financial assistance to pay off hefty medical bills and, in such instances, Credify Capital offers a quick medical emergency loan with flexible loan tenure." class="w-7 h-7 object-contain" /></span><div><strong>Pay medical bills- </strong> Medical emergencies can take a toll on your finances. Even if you have health insurance, it may not cover all medical expenses during emergency. You may need prompt financial assistance to pay off hefty medical bills and, in such instances, Credify Capital offers a quick medical emergency loan with flexible loan tenure.</div></li>

                                       <li class="flex items-start gap-3 my-2"><span class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1"><img src="/img/wedding-celebrations.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="Host a wedding-  Weddings have become expensive. You can get a loan to cover these high-cost wedding expenses." class="w-7 h-7 object-contain" /></span><div><strong>Host a wedding- </strong> Weddings have become expensive. You can get a loan to cover these high-cost wedding expenses.</div></li>

                                       <li class="flex items-start gap-3 my-2"><span class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1"><img src="/img/travel-or-vacation.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="Cover travel expenses-  If you're planning a vacation in India or abroad, and you're looking for ways to pay for it, a Personal Loan for travel is the right choice for you." class="w-7 h-7 object-contain" /></span><div><strong>Cover travel expenses- </strong> If you're planning a vacation in India or abroad, and you're looking for ways to pay for it, a Personal Loan for travel is the right choice for you.</div></li>

                                    </ul>

