                                    <ul>

                                       <li class="flex items-start gap-3 my-2"><span class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1"><img src="/img/easy-processing.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="Step 1: Click on the ‘Apply Now’ button." class="w-7 h-7 object-contain" /></span><div>Step 1: Click on the ‘Apply Now’ button.</div></li>

                                       <li class="flex items-start gap-3 my-2"><span class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1"><img src="/img/documents-table-arrow.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="Step 2: Fill in the required details on the loan application form." class="w-7 h-7 object-contain" /></span><div>Step 2: Fill in the required details on the loan application form.</div></li>

